-
-### Example 3: Restore Specific Files
-
-```bash
-# Scenario: Accidentally updated wrong files in last commit
-
-git show HEAD --name-only
-# commit abc123
-# feat: update documentation
-#   AGENTS.md (should not have changed)
-#   docs/API.md
-#   README.md
-
-bunx forge rollback
